        { "host": "B", "text": "The detail that stays with me is how they were found. CSIS says every breach came to light through voluntary disclosures from AI providers or the response team's own threat hunting. None of the affected organisations spotted it themselves." },
        { "host": "A", "text": "And the response was quick. CSIS says that on November 4th the team issued AI security auditing guidelines putting all AI systems into four risk tiers, requiring AI-related incidents to be reported within six hours, and requiring enterprises to keep system logs for 180 days." },
        { "host": "B", "text": "This rests on a single source. It's CSIS's account, and we could not open the underlying advisory or the guidelines directly." }
